values('project-environment-03','project-environment',1,'1.6','A new statutory accessibility requirement changes what an online service must provide. Which PESTLE heading is most directly involved?','[{"id":"a","text":"Legal."},{"id":"b","text":"Economic."},{"id":"c","text":"Technological."},{"id":"d","text":"Environmental."}]'::jsonb,'a','A statutory requirement is a legal influence. Implementing it may involve technology or cost, but those consequences do not change the primary source of the requirement. Environmental here concerns ecological or natural-world factors.')
