values('project-programme-portfolio-01','project-programme-portfolio',1,'1.5','An organisation coordinates a new appointment website, staff training and redesigned telephone processes to reduce missed appointments. Which description best fits that joint coordination?','[{"id":"a","text":"One work package within the website project."},{"id":"b","text":"Routine service operation only."},{"id":"c","text":"Programme management of related change and benefits."},{"id":"d","text":"Portfolio selection of unrelated investments only."}]'::jsonb,'c','Related initiatives and operational change are coordinated to produce a combined benefit, which is programme work. A work package is a smaller delivery unit. Portfolio management focuses on investment alignment and balance; routine operations alone do not describe the coordinated change.')
