values('project-roles-02','project-roles',1,'3.1','A delay could exceed the project manager’s delegated budget authority. What is the most appropriate next step?','[{"id":"a","text":"Increase the approved budget personally."},{"id":"b","text":"Wait until closure to report the variance."},{"id":"c","text":"Assess impacts and options, then escalate through agreed governance."},{"id":"d","text":"Transfer sponsorship to the supplier without approval."}]'::jsonb,'c','The manager should provide decision-quality evidence and escalate to the authorised role. Acting beyond delegated authority or concealing the problem undermines governance; a supplier cannot simply be assigned sponsorship.')
on conflict(id) do update set content_version=excluded.content_version,syllabus_ref=excluded.syllabus_ref,stem=excluded.stem,choices=excluded.choices,correct_option_id=excluded.correct_option_id,explanation=excluded.explanation where current.content_version<=excluded.content_version;
