values('business-case-02','business-case',1,'4.7','Which statement describes a benefit rather than merely a delivered output?','[{"id":"a","text":"Three printing kiosks have been installed."},{"id":"b","text":"Measured student queue time has reduced after adopting self-service printing."},{"id":"c","text":"A training document has been written."},{"id":"d","text":"The supplier has submitted a commissioning checklist."}]'::jsonb,'b','A measured improvement in use is a benefit. Kiosks, documents and checklists are outputs or delivery evidence. Their existence can support a benefit but does not prove that it has happened.')
