values('business-case-03','business-case',1,'4.5','Which pairing correctly describes responsibility for a business case?','[{"id":"a","text":"Users own it; the sponsor only writes meeting minutes."},{"id":"b","text":"The supplier always owns it; the manager must not contribute."},{"id":"c","text":"The sponsor is accountable; the manager supplies realistic delivery information."},{"id":"d","text":"The PMO owns every case regardless of the governance arrangements."}]'::jsonb,'c','The sponsor is accountable for justification while the manager helps maintain delivery estimates, risks and change impacts. Users, suppliers and the PMO can contribute evidence without automatically becoming the accountable investment owner.')
