values('project-life-cycles-01','project-life-cycles',1,'2.3','A project uses sequential construction approvals but develops its booking interface through repeated user-feedback cycles. Which life-cycle description fits best?','[{"id":"a","text":"Hybrid."},{"id":"b","text":"Only business as usual."},{"id":"c","text":"Linear with no iterative element."},{"id":"d","text":"An extended life cycle solely because there are two suppliers."}]'::jsonb,'a','Combining linear and iterative elements is a hybrid approach. Supplier count does not define an extended life cycle, which concerns the wider period of outcomes and benefits. The example describes temporary change, not only routine operations.')
