values('project-management-plan-03','project-management-plan',1,'4.10','What is the best reason to agree measurable success criteria near the start?','[{"id":"a","text":"To ensure success can never be questioned."},{"id":"b","text":"To make risk management unnecessary."},{"id":"c","text":"To guarantee every stakeholder values exactly the same thing."},{"id":"d","text":"To align expectations and provide evidence for delivery decisions and acceptance."}]'::jsonb,'d','Success criteria clarify how results will be judged and support decisions and acceptance. They do not guarantee success, remove uncertainty or eliminate legitimate differences between stakeholders.')
