values('stakeholder-engagement-02','stakeholder-engagement',1,'4.6','Which output shows that stakeholder analysis has informed action?','[{"id":"a","text":"An alphabetical contact list with no further decisions."},{"id":"b","text":"A promise to send every person every document."},{"id":"c","text":"A targeted engagement action, owner and review point based on the group’s concerns."},{"id":"d","text":"A rule that the analysis must never change."}]'::jsonb,'c','Analysis should shape engagement. Contacts alone do not explain needs or actions, and blanket distribution may be unhelpful or inappropriate. Interests, influence and impacts can change during delivery.')
