values('stakeholder-engagement-03','stakeholder-engagement',1,'4.6','A new operator joins the project and changes how the service will be used. What should happen to the stakeholder analysis?','[{"id":"a","text":"Review it and adjust engagement where interests, impacts or responsibilities have changed."},{"id":"b","text":"Archive it immediately because the project has already started."},{"id":"c","text":"Keep it unchanged to preserve an alphabetical order."},{"id":"d","text":"Replace all engagement with a cost estimate."}]'::jsonb,'a','Changed stakeholders and operating assumptions are reasons to revisit analysis. Preserving an obsolete list is not useful control, and cost estimating does not replace engagement planning.')
