values('communication-01','communication',1,'9.1','A report was sent successfully, but its recipient misunderstood the decision required. What best explains the gap?','[{"id":"a","text":"Communication is complete as soon as a file is sent."},{"id":"b","text":"The report must contain more pages, regardless of purpose."},{"id":"c","text":"The recipient should be removed from the stakeholder list."},{"id":"d","text":"Transmission occurred, but shared understanding and feedback were not established."}]'::jsonb,'d','Communication involves meaning and understanding, not only delivery of data. Clarification and feedback may be needed. More pages or exclusion do not automatically solve the misunderstanding.')
