values('communication-02','communication',1,'9.4','Which information belongs in a communication-plan entry?','[{"id":"a","text":"Only a colour for the report cover."},{"id":"b","text":"Audience, purpose/content, method, timing, owner and feedback route."},{"id":"c","text":"Only the total project budget."},{"id":"d","text":"A permanent promise to use one method for every audience."}]'::jsonb,'b','A useful entry connects the audience’s information need with practical delivery and feedback arrangements. A budget or document appearance alone cannot coordinate communication, and methods should fit different purposes.')
