values('communication-03','communication',1,'9.3','Which is a realistic disadvantage of virtual communication for a dispersed team?','[{"id":"a","text":"It is impossible to share a document virtually."},{"id":"b","text":"It always requires physical travel."},{"id":"c","text":"Technology access, time zones and missing non-verbal cues can hinder understanding."},{"id":"d","text":"It guarantees that every participant understands immediately."}]'::jsonb,'c','Virtual methods can improve reach while introducing access, timing and interpretation challenges. They can share documents and reduce travel, but no channel guarantees understanding.')
