values('risk-and-issue-management-01','risk-and-issue-management',1,'7.7','A component has already arrived damaged and needs a decision about replacement. How should this situation primarily be handled?','[{"id":"a","text":"As a current issue requiring assessment, ownership and resolution."},{"id":"b","text":"Only as a future uncertain event with no present action."},{"id":"c","text":"As proof that the project has no remaining risks."},{"id":"d","text":"As an automatically approved scope reduction."}]'::jsonb,'a','The damage is a current problem, so issue management is needed. It may create further risks or change requests, but it should not remain only a hypothetical risk or trigger an unauthorised scope decision.')
