values('risk-and-issue-management-02','risk-and-issue-management',1,'7.4','Which risk-register entry is most useful for management?','[{"id":"a","text":"A red square with no description."},{"id":"b","text":"An unnamed concern copied from another project."},{"id":"c","text":"A problem title with no review date or action."},{"id":"d","text":"A cause/event/effect description with assessment, owner, response and review status."}]'::jsonb,'d','The register should support decisions and follow-up. A colour, copied concern or bare title does not explain exposure or who will act. The detail should remain proportionate to the risk.')
