values('risk-and-issue-management-03','risk-and-issue-management',1,'7.1','Which statement correctly describes a project risk?','[{"id":"a","text":"It must be a problem that has already occurred."},{"id":"b","text":"It concerns uncertainty that could affect objectives, positively or negatively."},{"id":"c","text":"It is always a supplier invoice."},{"id":"d","text":"It can only exist after handover."}]'::jsonb,'b','Risk includes uncertain threats and opportunities. A current problem is an issue, and invoices or handover dates are not defining characteristics of risk.')
