values('scope-management-03','scope-management',1,'5.4','What is the purpose of a responsibility assignment matrix?','[{"id":"a","text":"Connect work or deliverables to responsible and accountable roles."},{"id":"b","text":"Calculate the critical path from activity durations."},{"id":"c","text":"Replace the business case with a supplier price list."},{"id":"d","text":"Guarantee that each project must employ nine people."}]'::jsonb,'a','A RAM links responsibilities to work. Scheduling calculations and investment justification are different purposes. Nine team-role contributions come from Belbin and are not a required staffing number or a RAM rule.')
