values('estimating-01','estimating',1,'4.8','An installer uses a validated rate of £18 per metre for a 240-metre cable-installation element. Which method and amount are correct?','[{"id":"a","text":"Analogous, £2,400."},{"id":"b","text":"Analytical, £18."},{"id":"c","text":"No estimating method, £4,800."},{"id":"d","text":"Parametric, £4,320."}]'::jsonb,'d','A quantity multiplied by an applicable rate is parametric estimating: 240 × 18 = 4,320. A prior comparable total would be analogous; estimating and combining work packages would be analytical. The rate’s inclusions still need checking.')
