values('estimating-02','estimating',1,'4.9','What does the estimating funnel illustrate?','[{"id":"a","text":"Every estimate must become a fixed price immediately."},{"id":"b","text":"The uncertainty range generally narrows as information and understanding improve."},{"id":"c","text":"Exact decimal places eliminate uncertainty."},{"id":"d","text":"Early estimates always use more detail than later estimates."}]'::jsonb,'b','The funnel represents improving confidence as evidence develops. It does not guarantee accuracy or justify false precision. An early estimate normally has less supporting detail and needs its assumptions and range explained.')
