values('estimating-03','estimating',1,'4.8','A manager adjusts the total cost of a comparable completed project to estimate a new one. Which method is being used?','[{"id":"a","text":"Critical path analysis."},{"id":"b","text":"Configuration accounting."},{"id":"c","text":"Analogous estimating."},{"id":"d","text":"Quality control."}]'::jsonb,'c','Analogous estimating draws on comparable previous work and adjusts for differences. The other activities concern scheduling, configuration records or output checks, rather than estimating from a comparable total.')
