values('resource-scheduling-01','resource-scheduling',1,'6.2','A takes 2 days. B takes 3 days after A. C takes 4 days after A. D takes 2 days after both B and C. With sufficient resources, what is the earliest finish?','[{"id":"a","text":"8 days, determined by A–C–D."},{"id":"b","text":"7 days, determined by A–B–D."},{"id":"c","text":"11 days because B and C must always be sequential."},{"id":"d","text":"4 days because C is the longest individual activity."}]'::jsonb,'a','The parallel paths take 7 and 8 days; the longer dependency chain determines completion. B and C need not be sequential when resources permit parallel working. The longest single activity is not the same as the critical path.')
