values('resource-scheduling-02','resource-scheduling',1,'6.5','An activity is moved only within available float to reduce a resource peak while retaining the finish date. What is this?','[{"id":"a","text":"Benefits realisation."},{"id":"b","text":"Automatic scope acceptance."},{"id":"c","text":"A procurement strategy."},{"id":"d","text":"Resource smoothing."}]'::jsonb,'d','Smoothing uses available flexibility while preserving the finish date. Levelling addresses resource limits and may extend completion. Benefits, scope acceptance and procurement concern other management decisions.')
