values('information-and-reporting-01','information-and-reporting',1,'4.11','Eight of ten units are installed, but only four have passed acceptance tests. What should a useful report do?','[{"id":"a","text":"Call all eight accepted to maintain a green status."},{"id":"b","text":"Show installation only and omit the reporting date."},{"id":"c","text":"Distinguish installation from acceptance and explain the forecast impact."},{"id":"d","text":"Avoid mentioning the issue until every test is finished."}]'::jsonb,'c','Different completion states need clear evidence and a reporting date. Explaining the effect on the remaining work supports decisions. Re-labelling or concealing the gap gives a misleading picture.')
