values('information-and-reporting-02','information-and-reporting',1,'4.11','What most improves a sponsor report about a forecast delay?','[{"id":"a","text":"A clear explanation of impact, options and the decision required from the sponsor."},{"id":"b","text":"More pages of unfiltered activity logs regardless of relevance."},{"id":"c","text":"Removing uncertainty from the wording even when evidence is incomplete."},{"id":"d","text":"Replacing the approved baseline with the forecast without approval."}]'::jsonb,'a','The sponsor needs timely decision-quality information. Volume is not a substitute for relevance, uncertainty should be honest, and the baseline must remain a controlled reference.')
