values('leadership-and-teamwork-01','leadership-and-teamwork',1,'10.4','A new team needs orientation and clearer roles, and members are beginning to disagree about ways of working. How can Tuckman’s model help?','[{"id":"a","text":"Prove that the team will improve without leadership action."},{"id":"b","text":"Suggest forming/storming needs to explore, while the manager listens and adapts support."},{"id":"c","text":"Require the manager to dismiss everyone who disagrees."},{"id":"d","text":"Replace observation with a permanent label for each person."}]'::jsonb,'b','The model helps diagnose possible team needs, not predict inevitable progress or label individuals. Constructive disagreement needs appropriate support; ignoring it or treating all disagreement as misconduct is not justified by the model.')
