values('leadership-and-teamwork-02','leadership-and-teamwork',1,'10.4','A team has strong ideas but little attention to organising implementation and checking detail. What is a useful Belbin-based response?','[{"id":"a","text":"Recruit exactly nine people, regardless of project needs."},{"id":"b","text":"Assign each person a permanent job title based only on a label."},{"id":"c","text":"Discuss missing contributions and how existing members or support could provide them."},{"id":"d","text":"Assume only the sponsor can contribute practical organisation."}]'::jsonb,'c','Belbin can prompt discussion of complementary contributions. Roles are not fixed job titles and one person can contribute in several ways. Team composition should address actual needs, not a compulsory headcount.')
